dhcp: Do not cache a network whose dnsmasq failed to start

DhcpLocalProcess.enable logged a dnsmasq start timeout and returned
None, and _call_driver reported success anyway, so the agent cached the
network and marked its ports DHCP-ready. enable now returns False, and
_call_driver returns that and schedules a resync for the network.

enable returns False rather than raising so that callers which ignore
its result, such as DhcpBase.restart, behave as before.

